 bonuses or other rewards, you'll find plenty of exciting opportunities to boost your bankroll and extend your playing time at Woohoo Slots.\r\nHUGE & FREE game rewards and prizes awarded ALL THE TIME when spinning in slot machines! Enjoy diverse events and get FREE COINS from Levelroad, Amazing Cards, interesting Picnic Picks, woohoo cooking and more.\r\n\ud83d\udcb5Collect 3,000,000 Welcome Bonus after FIRST LOGIN!\r\n\ud83d\udcb5Collect 250,000 Login Bonus EVERY DAY.\r\n\ud83d\udcb5Get Large Amount of Coins and additional Rewards every time you Level Up.\r\n\ud83d\udcb5Collect 3,,000,000 FREE COINS by binding to Facebook.\r\n\ud83d\udcb5Get Multiple Times FREE Bonus and Lucky Spin ALL in Woohoo Rewards.\r\n\ud83d\udcb5Collect every set of Amazing Cards and fill in your Favorites and Get MORE Coins.\r\n\ud83e\uddfaGo on a picnic with friends at Picnic Pick. Every Pick brings you a Surprise Reward.\r\n\ud83c\udfb1Let's Play Bingo! Every \"BINGO\" shows your ingenuity and good luck.\r\n\ud83c\udf73Become a chef at Woohoo Cooking and cook every dish to complete challenges and win BIG PRIZES.\r\nWoohoo slots offers Real casino slot game machines designed by REAL Casino slots experts. Whether you fancy classic slot machines or the latest casino slot games, you can find them in Woohoo Slots! Furthermore, our casino is continuing to update new slot machines, keep fresh & AMAZING!\r\nKeep Spinning and Winning!\r\n\r\nNOTE:\r\nCash out is not possible.\r\nThis product is intended for entertainment purposes only and is for users 18 years of age or older.\r\nThis game contains in-app purchases.\r\nPlaying or winning at social casino games does not imply future winning at real money casinos and related games.",
